SUMMARY:Sydnee Washington: My Black Barbie Story
LOCATION:The Bell House\, Carroll Gardens-Cobble Hill-Gowanus-Red Hook
DESCRIPTION:Sydnee Washington has lived babe\, many lives. Lowkey high key\
 
, nights so embarrassing only Black Barbie can reenact in a stop motion liv
 
e show. Follow Sydnee's life story from childhood\, to making questionable 
 
decisions as a bottle girl in the iconic nightclubs of 2010s NYC--& how she
 
 eventually climbed her way out through sobriety &\, funnily enough\, stand
 
-up comedy. Join her in an unhinged night of judgment\, laughs & maybe even
 
 a bit of inspiration. Door Time: 6:30pm (front bar opens: 5:30pm). Show Ti
 
me: 7:30pm. 21 & over w/ valid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admiss
 
ion standing & seating. Seating 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arriv
 
e early for best selection. If you have an accessibility request\, please e
 
mail thebellhouse@livenation.com prior. No outside food/drink. $.25 per eac
 
h ticket sold for a majority of events @ The Bell House benefits Comedy Giv
 
es Back\, a safety net for the comedy community. IG: @comedygivesback. Tick
 
ets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/sydnee-washington-my-black-barbie-
 
story-brooklyn-new-york-10-23-2026/event/300065273C85AE0A
