ill
DESCRIPTION:Cirque Kalabanté returns to KCA after a sold-out 2024 run with
 
 WOW (World of Words) - a vibrant performance that transcends language and 
 
connects worlds. Rooted in ancestral African wisdom\, the show unfolds thro
 
ugh storytelling\, song\, and ritual\, where division gives way to connecti
 
on. As words fade\, gesture\, rhythm\, and movement take over - with ropes\
 
, acrobatics\, and physical play becoming a shared language. Guided by Trus
 
t\, Respect\, and Wisdom\, barriers dissolve in a powerful finale of unity 
 
and collective awakening. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/cirq
 
